  subtitles:
  - startTime: 0
    endTime: 1.8
    text: Bamboo needs water to grow,
  - startTime: 1.8
    endTime: 3.8
    text: and in a drought it withers.
  - startTime: 3.8
    endTime: 6
    text: That means there is less and less food.
  - startTime: 6
    endTime: 8
    text: Pandas normally follow the bamboo
  - startTime: 8
    endTime: 9.5
    text: and travel down the mountain
  - startTime: 9.5
    endTime: 11
    text: when it becomes scarce.
